      "reasoning": "They attacked with a 2/2 Forest and a 4/4 Mountain. Neither has trample, so I can chump the Mountain with a 1/1 and only take the 2 damage from the Forest. I have Invasion Reinforcements and an Ally Token as blockers. Blocking the Mountain 4/4 with Invasion Reinforcements keeps the token (for future Ally triggers) and I drop to 8 life instead of 4. Then next turn my 7/7 Avatar Enthusiasts untaps and the opponent is at 6 life — very close to lethal.",
