      "result": "{\"log\":\"PilotB turn 1:\\nPilotB played Plains\\nPilotA turn 1:\\nPilotA drew Mountain\\nPilotA played Forest\\nPilotB turn 2:\\nPilotB drew a card\\nPilotB played Forest\\n[Chat] PilotB: Good luck! Let\\u0026#39;s see if my little critters can keep up with whatever you\\u0026#39;re brewing over there. \\u0026#127793;\\nPilotB cast Raucous Audience\\nPilotA turn 2:\\nPilotA drew Earthbending Lesson\\n[Chat] PilotA: Good luck to you too! I\\u0027ll see if my benders can handle your little critters.\\n[Chat] PilotA: Good luck to you too! I\\u0026#39;ll see if my benders can handle your little critters.\\nPilotA played Mountain\\nPilotA cast Firebending Lesson\\nRaucous Audience was destroyed (PilotB)\\nPilotB turn 3:\\nPilotB drew a card\\nPilotB played Plains\\nPilotA turn 3:\\nPilotA drew Turtle-Duck\\nPilotA played Forest\\nPilotA cast Toph, the Blind Bandit\\nPilotB turn 4:\\nPilotB drew a card\\n[Chat] PilotB: Nice Toph \\u0026mdash; earthbending my own tempo away, huh? Let\\u0026#39;s see if my allies can keep up!\\nPilotB played Forest\\nPilotB cast Avatar Enthusiasts\\nPilotA turn 4:\\nPilotA drew Bitter Work\\n[Chat] PilotA: Toph\\u0027s just getting warmed up. Your allies better dig deep!\\n[Chat] PilotA: Toph\\u0026#39;s just getting warmed up. Your allies better dig deep!\\nPilotA played Mountain\\n[Chat] PilotA: Avatar Enthusiasts still sleeping off the summoning sickness — I\\u0027m swinging in.\\n[Chat] PilotA: Avatar Enthusiasts still sleeping off the summoning sickness \\u0026mdash; I\\u0026#39;m swinging in.\\nPilotB lost 2 life\\nPilotB lost 2 life\\nPilotA cast Bitter Work\\nPilotB turn 5:\\nPilotB drew a card\\nPilotB cast Haru, Hidden Talent\\n[Chat] PilotB: Ally squad is assembling! Haru joins the party \\u0026#128050;\\nPilotB cast Momo, Playful Pet\\nPilotA lost 1 life\\nPilotA lost 4 life\\nPilotA turn 5:\\nPilotA drew Rebellious Captives\\nPilotA played Mountain\\nPilotB blocked Forest with Momo, Playful Pet\\nPilotA activated Bitter Work\\u0027s ability\\nPilotB lost 6 life\\nMomo, Playful Pet was destroyed (PilotB)\\nPilotB turn 6:\\nPilotB drew a card\\nPilotB cast Invasion Reinforcements\\nPilotB cast Allies at Last\\nToph, the Blind Bandit was destroyed (PilotA)\\n[Chat] PilotB: Swinging big this turn \\u0026mdash; Toph is gone, and now Avatar Enthusiasts is a 7/7. Good luck blocking this!\\nPilotA lost 1 life\\nPilotA lost 7 life\\nPilotA lost 1 life\\nPilotA turn 6:\\nPilotA drew Mountain\\n[Chat] PilotA: Toph\\u0027s gone, but the earth still remembers. I think this turn ends it.\\n[Chat] PilotA: Toph\\u0026#39;s gone, but the earth still remembers. I think this turn ends it.\\nPilotA played Mountain\\nPilotA drew Earthbending Lesson\\nPilotB blocked Mountain with Invasion Reinforcements\\nPilotB lost 2 life\\nInvasion Reinforcements was destroyed (PilotB)\",\"total_length\":2588,\"truncated\":false,\"cursor\":85}",
