        "content": "{\"analysis\":\"Building a GW Allies deck. White is the deepest color with a strong Ally theme (Invasion Reinforcements, Kyoshi Warriors, White Lotus Reinforcements, Suki, Hakoda, Avatar Enthusiasts) that powers up Yip Yip!, Haru, Allies at Last, and Invasion Tactics. Green adds Badgermole Cub, Haru, Raucous Audience, and the Ally payoffs. I left out: the fifth Yip Yip! (too many tricks), both Compassionate Healers (weak filler), Rabaroo Troop (heavy WW cost, mostly a Plains cycler), Turtle-Duck and Foggy Swamp Vinebender (mediocre beaters off-theme), both Cycle of Renewals (ramp the deck doesn't need), and all blue, black, and red cards (Octopus Form, North Pole Patrol, Dai Li Indoctrination, Hog-Monkey, Yuyan Archers) — none are worth splashing. The drafted non-basic lands (Kyoshi Village, Rumble Arenas) are excluded per the non-land-only instruction.\",\"chosen_spells\":[\"Razor Rings\",\"Airbender Ascension\",\"Sandbenders' Storm\",\"Yip Yip!\",\"Yip Yip!\",\"Yip Yip!\",\"Yip Yip!\",\"White Lotus Reinforcements\",\"Invasion Reinforcements\",\"Invasion Reinforcements\",\"Momo, Playful Pet\",\"Kyoshi Warriors\",\"Glider Kids\",\"Path to Redemption\",\"Suki, Courageous Rescuer\",\"Avatar Enthusiasts\",\"Avatar Enthusiasts\",\"Hakoda, Selfless Commander\",\"Haru, Hidden Talent\",\"Allies at Last\",\"Badgermole Cub\",\"Invasion Tactics\",\"Raucous Audience\"],\"decision\":\"accept\"}",
        "reasoning": "Let me analyze the drafted cards.\n\
\n\
Colors:\n\
- White: Razor Rings, Airbender Ascension, Sandbenders' Storm, Yip Yip! x5, Invasion Reinforcements x2, Compassionate Healer x2, Momo, Kyoshi Warriors, Glider Kids, Path to Redemption, Suki, Avatar Enthusiasts x2, Hakoda, Rabaroo Troop, White Lotus Reinforcements (GW)\n\
- Green: White Lotus Reinforcements, Turtle-Duck, Haru, Allies at Last, Foggy Swamp Vinebender, Cycle of Renewal x2, Badgermole Cub, Invasion Tactics, Raucous Audience\n\
- Blue: Octopus Form, North Pole Patrol, Island\n\
- Black: Dai Li Indoctrination, Hog-Monkey, Swamp\n\
- Red: Yuyan Archers\n\
